        <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-dot"></div><div class="timeline-card"><h4 data-en="6. Delivery Planning" data-he="6. תכנון משלוח">6. Delivery Planning</h4><p data-en="Status: Pending" data-he="סטטוס: ממתין">Status: Pending</p></div></div>
        <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-dot"></div><div class="timeline-card"><h4 data-en="7. Ongoing Wellness & Follow-up" data-he="7. רווחה שוטפת ומעקב">7. Ongoing Wellness & Follow-up</h4><p data-en="Status: Pending" data-he="סטטוס: ממתין">Status: Pending</p></div></div>
