      <div class="form-checkbox"><input type="checkbox" id="auth2" class="auth-check"><label for="auth2" data-en="I understand that the proposed recognition items remain subject to confirmation." data-he="אני מבין/ה כי פריטי ההוקרה המוצעים נשארים כפופים לאישור.">I understand that the proposed recognition items remain subject to confirmation.</label></div>
      <div class="form-checkbox"><input type="checkbox" id="auth3" class="auth-check"><label for="auth3" data-en="I understand that providing an address does not guarantee shipment." data-he="אני מבין/ה כי מתן כתובת אינו מבטיח משלוח.">I understand that providing an address does not guarantee shipment.</label></div>
      <div class="form-checkbox"><input type="checkbox" id="auth4" class="auth-check"><label for="auth4" data-en="I acknowledge the portal's privacy and information-handling terms." data-he="אני מכיר/ה בתנאי הפרטיות וטיפול במידע של הפורטל.">I acknowledge the portal's privacy and information-handling terms.</label></div>
