          <p class="email-subtitle" data-en="For assistance with your delivery request, contact the support team below." data-he="לסיוע בבקשת המשלוח שלך, צור קשר עם צוות התמיכה למטה.">For assistance with your delivery request, contact the support team below.</p>
          <a href="mailto:humanitarianaidservicesaccess@gmail.com" class="email-link"><i class="fas fa-envelope"></i> humanitarianaidservicesaccess@gmail.com</a>
