      <h2 data-en="Frequently Asked <span class='gold-text'>Questions</span>" data-he="שאלות <span class='gold-text'>נפוצות</span>">Frequently Asked <span class="gold-text">Questions</span></h2>
      <div id="faqContainer">
        <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span data-en="What is the programme?" data-he="מהי התכנית?">What is the programme?</span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down faq-chevron"></i></div><div class="faq-answer" data-en="A structured administrative portal for proposed recognition opportunities for wounded military personnel." data-he="פורטל מנהלי מובנה להזדמנויות הוקרה מוצעות עבור חיילים פצועים.">A structured administrative portal for proposed recognition opportunities for wounded military personnel.</div></div>
        <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span data-en="Is the $120,000 financial recognition confirmed?" data-he="האם ההכרה הכספית של $120,000 מאושרת?">Is the $120,000 financial recognition confirmed?</span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down faq-chevron"></i></div><div class="faq-answer" data-en="No. It is a proposed benefit subject to eligibility, approval, and formal confirmation." data-he="לא. זוהי הטבה מוצעת הכפופה לזכאות, אישור ואישור רשמי.">No. It is a proposed benefit subject to eligibility, approval, and formal confirmation.</div></div>
        <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span data-en="Is the Tesla vehicle guaranteed?" data-he="האם רכב הטסלה מובטח?">Is the Tesla vehicle guaranteed?</span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down faq-chevron"></i></div><div class="faq-answer" data-en="No. The Tesla is a proposed recognition item until independently confirmed." data-he="לא. הטסלה היא פריט הוקרה מוצע עד לאישור עצמאי.">No. The Tesla is a proposed recognition item until independently confirmed.</div></div>
        <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span data-en="Why is there a two-minute countdown?" data-he="מדוע יש ספירה לאחור של שתי דקות?">Why is there a two-minute countdown?</span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down faq-chevron"></i></div><div class="faq-answer" data-en="The two-minute countdown is an administrative waiting period separating application submission from dashboard access." data-he="הספירה לאחור של שתי דקות היא תקופת המתנה מנהלית המפרידה בין הגשת הבקשה לגישה ללוח הבקרה.">The two-minute countdown is an administrative waiting period separating application submission from dashboard access.</div></div>
        <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span data-en="How do I enter my delivery address?" data-he="כיצד אזין את כתובת המשלוח שלי?">How do I enter my delivery address?</span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down faq-chevron"></i></div><div class="faq-answer" data-en="After the dashboard unlocks, proceed to the Delivery Center to submit your information." data-he="לאחר שלוח הבקרה נפתח, המשך למרכז המשלוחים כדי להזין את פרטיך.">After the dashboard unlocks, proceed to the Delivery Center to submit your information.</div></div>
        <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span data-en="How is personal information protected?" data-he="כיצד מידע אישי מוגן?">How is personal information protected?</span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down faq-chevron"></i></div><div class="faq-answer" data-en="Personal information is collected only for clearly explained and legitimate purposes. It is protected through secure authentication, encrypted storage, and strict access controls." data-he="מידע אישי נאסף רק למטרות מוסברות ולגיטימיות בבירור. הוא מוגן באמצעות אימות מאובטח, אחסון מוצפן ובקרות גישה קפדניות.">Personal information is collected only for clearly explained and legitimate purposes. It is protected through secure authentication, encrypted storage, and strict access controls.</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
